@startuml 2.2.10_L2
title L2 – Components & Access
actor REP as "Shipping Agent Rep"
participant UI as "SPA"
participant API as "PortOps API"
participant IAM as "External IAM (JWT)"
participant RB as "RBAC"
database DB as "DB"

REP -> UI : Open "My VVNs"
UI -> API : GET /api/vvns?... + Bearer JWT
API -> IAM : Validate/Introspect JWT
IAM --> API : Valid (role: SHIPPING_AGENT_REP, orgId)
API -> RB : Check role + scope(orgId)
RB --> API : Allowed
API -> DB : Query VVNs WHERE organizationId = orgId (+filters)
DB --> API : Rows
API --> UI : 200 OK [items]
UI --> REP : Render list
@enduml